<header class="hero" id="welcome"><p class="eyebrow">Legacy to Live By · Testnet demo, no real accounts</p><h1>Human Gold Rush</h1><p class="intro">Explore how community force grows through service and how it compares with trade. Churches, merchants, community centers, and neighbors gather through LAUGH events to practice trust, recognize gratitude, and fulfill future plans.</p><blockquote>What becomes possible when a community treats presence and follow-through as its first resources?</blockquote><p class="section-label">Scan the postcard, then decide</p><div class="actions"><a href="prepare-laugh-event.html" class="cta-mega">Participate as a MEGAvoter<span>→</span></a><a href="#" class="cta-yam disabled" id="observe-link" aria-disabled="true" title="Choose a Peace Pentagon branch below first">Observe as a YAM’er<span>→</span></a><a href="three-ways-to-respond.html" class="cta-walk">Walk Away, No Pressure<span>→</span></a></div><div class="pentagon"><p class="section-label">Choosing to Observe? Pick a Peace Pentagon branch first — this is required, not optional, for YAM’ers</p><div class="pentagon-branches" role="group" aria-label="Peace Pentagon branch"><button type="button" data-branch="planning">Planning</button><button type="button" data-branch="budget">Budget</button><button type="button" data-branch="media">Media</button><button type="button" data-branch="distribution">Distribution</button><button type="button" data-branch="membership">Membership</button></div><small>Choosing a branch unlocks “Observe as a YAM’er” above and takes you straight to that branch’s section in Discord Gracebook. MEGAvoters may pick a branch too, but it isn’t required to Participate.</small></div><form class="rsvp-email" action="#" method="post"><label for="rsvp-email">RSVP with your email — how will you show up?</label><div class="rsvp-row"><input id="rsvp-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required><input type="hidden" name="pentagon_branch" id="pentagon-branch-value"><button type="submit">Count Me In<span>→</span></button></div><label for="rsvp-stone" class="stone-label">Choose your touchstone</label><select id="rsvp-stone" name="touchstone"><option value="">Pick a word that speaks to you…</option><option value="courage">Courage (Tiger’s Eye)</option><option value="kindness">Kindness (Obsidian)</option><option value="wisdom">Wisdom (Howlite)</option><option value="lucky">Lucky (Unakite)</option><option value="belief">Belief (Crazy Agate)</option><option value="gratitude">Gratitude (Red Jasper)</option><option value="health">Health (Aventurine)</option><option value="happiness">Happiness (White Crystal)</option><option value="dream">Dream (Yellow Jade)</option><option value="believe">Believe (Sodalite)</option><option value="wealth">Wealth (India Agate)</option><option value="healing">Healing (Opal)</option><option value="not_yet">Not ready to accept a FAITH stone yet</option></select><small>Unwilling to accept a stone that embodies FAITH right now? Choose “not ready yet” — come back whenever it feels right. Nothing expires and no one follows up. This is your one touchstone for this path, not a set of twelve to collect.</small></form><aside class="notice"><strong>Pilot status</strong><p>Human Gold Rush is currently a single production site — the Center for Entrepreneurship and Innovation (CEI) at the University of North Georgia in Dahlonega, Georgia — delivering twelve engraved touchstone varieties, including the Tiger's Eye. Expansion to 100 additional CEI-model production licenses is projected for August 11, 2027. Until then, this remains a single-site pilot. Pick-up event status is checked by scanning your postcard's registered UUID.</p></aside><div class="path-compare"><p class="section-label">You’re invited — one postcard, one QR scan manages your whole RSVP</p><div class="path-grid"><div class="path-card"><h3>YAM’er (Observer) — “You And Me”</h3><ul><li>Free to RSVP</li><li>Receive a Practice FAITH touchstone</li><li>Observe and accept gratitude</li><li>Attend LAUGH events</li><li>No obligations — leave anytime</li></ul></div><div class="path-card gold"><h3>MEGAvoter (Participant / Seller / Messenger) — $12/year pledge</h3><ul><li>Choose a Peace Pentagon role</li><li>Help organize LAUGH events</li><li>Fulfill Organized Krill kits</li><li>Record presence and inspire others</li><li>Carries the FAITH-engraved Tiger’s Eye Worry-Prayer touchstone, cut locally at CEI</li></ul></div></div></div></header><section class="content-grid"><article><span>01</span><div><h2>Start with a touchstone</h2><p>The Tiger’s Eye Covenant is a physical reminder to practice FAITH: Fair, Accepting, Insightful, Transparent, and Humble. It is an invitation, never a condition of human worth.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2>Three voluntary responses</h2><p>Participate, observe, or walk away. Every response matters. A walk-away is behavioral gold because it may reveal missing trust, unclear purpose, poor timing, or an unseen barrier.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2>One twelve-week window</h2><p>Each quarter is a continuous twelve-week observation and maturity window. Activity accumulates throughout the whole period; it is not divided into prescribed participant phases.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h2>Trade value without money</h2><p>Seeking Gratitude recognizes presence, contribution, and fulfillment. It may carry trade value, but gratitude is never accepted as payment, currency, credit, or a financial claim.</p></div></article><article><span>05</span><div><h2>A pet rock, Pokémon-GO style</h2><p>Human Gold Rush borrows two familiar ideas — a pet rock’s meaning-from-nothing charm and a location-based scavenger hunt — to study whether people show up. Three universal QR codes (Identity, Banking/YAM-is-ON, Thanking/Seeking Gratitude) and a registered smartphone replace the app store purchase with a real handshake.</p></div></article><article><span>06</span><div><h2>Becoming a beacon</h2><p>You don’t have to already be a MEGAvoter, a YAM’er, or anything else to become a beacon in this study — that happens the moment your device registers on its first scan. From then on, your presence, not your identity, is what other nearby scans can corroborate against, the same witness-weighting that confirms a genuine LAUGH-event pickup.</p></div></article></section><section class="content-grid"><article><span>07</span><div><h2>One seller, two tools</h2><p>A MEGAvoter seller may use YAM-is-ON to collect $30 for an item or service, or Seeking Gratitude to distribute an item or service without accepting money. Each confirmed unit resolves to only one rail.</p></div></article><article><span>08</span><div><h2>A public testament</h2><p>Acting as VFN, the seller posts a monthly statement of YAM-is-ON obligations to the XP General Ledger. The statement records fiat activity for comparison; the ledger never holds the seller’s funds.</p></div></article></section>
